{"uid":"dynamo-local-sglang","title":"Dynamo - mock SGLang lab","description":"Full lab metric catalog, inference overview and live raw-series explorer. Real Dynamo, simulated inference; no physical GPU telemetry.","schemaVersion":39,"version":2,"refresh":"10s","time":{"from":"now-15m","to":"now"},"tags":["dynamo","sglang","simulation","full-metric-catalog"],"templating":{"list":[{"name":"job","label":"Source","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"query":"label_values(up{job!=\"routing-experiment\"}, job)","refresh":1,"includeAll":true,"multi":true,"allValue":".*","current":{"text":"All","value":"$__all"}},{"name":"instance","label":"Instance","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"query":"label_values(up{job=~\"$job\",job!=\"routing-experiment\"}, instance)","refresh":1,"includeAll":true,"multi":true,"allValue":".*","current":{"text":"All","value":"$__all"}},{"name":"metric","label":"Raw metric","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"query":"label_values({job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",job!=\"routing-experiment\"}, __name__)","refresh":1,"includeAll":true,"multi":true,"allValue":".*","current":{"text":"dynamo_frontend_requests_total","value":"dynamo_frontend_requests_total"}}]},"panels":[{"id":1,"type":"text","title":"Real Dynamo / simulated SGLang","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":24,"h":4},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"**0 metric families across 0 sections** in this catalog. Expand sections below the overview to see every family. Source and Instance filter the entire dashboard. The Raw metric explorer includes all live metric names, including histogram buckets, counts and sums, plus newly registered metrics.\n\nIsolated routing experiments are excluded here; use the dedicated live experiment dashboard.\n\n**Simulation boundary:** engine timing, KV use and GPU-slot accounting are simulated. There is no physical GPU utilization, power or VRAM telemetry. SLA-regression and power-planning metrics are not calibrated for this lab. **No data** means no samples were emitted or the feature is inactive, not zero."}},{"id":2,"title":"Overall QPS - completed requests","type":"timeseries","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":4,"w":8,"h":8},"interval":"15s","description":"Completed frontend requests per second, including success/error outcomes. Counted once at the frontend; never sum prefill and decode phase counts for overall QPS.","targets":[{"refId":"A","expr":"sum(rate(dynamo_frontend_requests_total{job=~\"${job:regex}\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",job!=\"routing-experiment\",dynamo_component_type=\"frontend\"}[$__rate_interval]))","range":true,"legendFormat":"overall"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"reqps","custom":{"lineWidth":1,"fillOpacity":5}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom","calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi","sort":"desc"}}},{"id":3,"title":"Output tokens / second","type":"timeseries","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":12,"w":12,"h":8},"interval":"15s","description":"","targets":[{"refId":"A","expr":"sum(rate(dynamo_frontend_output_tokens_total{job=~\"${job:regex}\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",job!=\"routing-experiment\"}[$__rate_interval]))","range":true}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"short","custom":{"lineWidth":1,"fillOpacity":5}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom","calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi","sort":"desc"}}},{"id":4,"title":"Time to first token - p50 / p95 / p99","type":"timeseries","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"gridPos":{"x":12,"y":12,"w":12,"h":8},"interval":"15s","description":"","targets":[{"refId":"A","expr":"histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(dynamo_frontend_time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket{job=~\"${job:regex}\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",job!=\"routin